# Emeq Hub × DataForSEO: zoekvolume (Google Ads search_volume/live)
#
# Setup: zie consumer/domain-overview.http en README.md.
# Betaalde call. Eén of 1000 keywords kost hetzelfde; DataForSEO staat
# maximaal 12 requests per minuut per account toe.

@baseUrl = http://hub.emeq.test:8092
@token = {{$dotenv EMEQ_HUB_PAT}}
@accountId = 47

### Zoekvolume, defaults location_code 2528 (NL) en language_code nl
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/search-volume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

{
  "keywords": ["theorie examen", "auto theorie", "rijschool utrecht"]
}

### Zonder keywords → 422 (validatie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/search-volume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

{}

### Zonder PAT → 401 unauthenticated
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/search-volume
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

{
  "keywords": ["theorie examen"]
}
